quotadial\-licence \- Say whether this copy is QuotaDial Free or QuotaDial Pro, or add or remove its licence key. A key is checked on this machine, with no network call
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquotadial licence\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
