Say whether this copy is QuotaDial Free or QuotaDial Pro, or add or remove its licence key. A key is checked on this machine, with no network call
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quotadial\-licence\-show(1)
Say which QuotaDial this copy is, and from which licence. The default
.TP
quotadial\-licence\-add(1)
Add a licence key for QuotaDial Pro, which replaces any kept before
